    "conclusions": "$AC = BE$且$AC \\parallel BE$；类似地$AB = CE$且$AB \\parallel CE$；四边形$ABEC$为平行四边形；当$\\angle BAC=90^\\circ$时，$AD = \\frac{1}{2}BC$。"
